  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: EXACTLY 50 original cozy pixel-art inventory/activity/profile sprites in ONE transparent atlas. Input images are STYLE REFERENCES ONLY: match Bayit hero and badge palette (vivid cobalt blue, golden yellow, navy outline, warm cream, soft lilac, warm brown and leafy green), crisp hard square pixels and simple 32/48pixel sprite silhouettes legible at64px. Do not reproduce a character. CANVAS: wide 2:1, target2560x1280 (2048x1024 acceptable), EXACT invisible regular grid of10 columns and5 rows. All50 cells equal square size. Every sprite centered in its cell, occupies60% of cell width/height, with20% clear transparent safe margin EACH SIDE; never cross cell boundaries. Match each icon's size optically. No labels/numbers/gridlines. No soft edges or blur. All sprites distinct, fully contained, no neighboring pieces. Exactly one requested sprite per cell.\nROW1 left-to-right: blue baseball cap; blue moon cape with golden crescent; yellow scarf; green backpack; lantern; blue star wizard hat; pair blue sneakers; wooden shield; heart badge; sun badge.\nROW2 left-to-right: moon badge; school bag badge; toothbrush badge; shower badge; helping hand badge; gold trophy; gold medal; silver medal; bronze medal; yellow star.\nROW3 left-to-right: blue house; cozy bed; open reading book; pencil cup; toy chest; puzzle piece; bicycle; football/soccer ball; musical note; paint palette.\nROW4 left-to-right: friendly dog; friendly cat; rabbit; bird; tiny friendly dragon; tree; houseplant; flowerpot; watering can; vegetable basket.\nROW5 left-to-right: milk carton; sliced bread; apple; rice bag with tiny rice grains emblem; dinner plate; alarm clock; calendar with simple blank grid no digits; gift box; rain cloud; smiling sun.\nBadge icons are compact round medallions with the specified motif. Do not put other sprites on medallions. All50 sprites must be drawn in strict row-major order with no omission or duplicate. True transparent alpha background throughout, including between every sprite. No text, words, letters, digits, UI, frames around cells, scenery, background, ground/floor shadows, extra decorative objects or watermarks. Original game sprite artwork, not existing copyrighted characters. Activity/profile art; only garment sprites depict wearable items.\n",
